  "owner": "FIX_INDIRECT_STATIONARY (movement: Remain Stationary to arm [INDIRECT FIRE] when the spotted shot is worth more than the move - OFF-07)",
  "rationale": "11e 10.07 (Indirect shooting): a unit that did not Advance may shoot its [INDIRECT FIRE] weapons at units none of its models can see; each such attack gives the target the benefit of cover (13.08: the attack's BS is worsened by 1) and its hit roll cannot be re-rolled, and an unmodified 1-5 fails - unless the firing unit Remained Stationary this turn (09.04: no model moves at all) AND the target is visible to one or more friendly units, in which case only an unmodified 1-3 fails. So for a battery whose target is unseen, staying put with a spotter is worth a whole extra band of the hit roll, and any move - even 1\" - throws it away. 02.02.01 (commentary, which wins over the launch text): BS can never be worse than 6+, so the band pays only while BS+1 is better than 6+: BS 3+ (4+ after the indirect cover) hits on 4+ instead of 6 - three times the hits - while a BS 5+ battery needs a 6 either way. Here U_CUSTODIAN_GUARD_B (Custodian Guard Beta, 5 models) carries a constructed BS 3+ [BLAST, INDIRECT FIRE] 36\" mortar (A2 S8 AP-2 D2 - the 11e Whirlwind vengeance launcher's BS and keywords, no [HEAVY]) on the west edge, more than 6.5\" from every objective's range; its only target, U_CUSTODIAN_GUARD_A_P2, stands with every base in area-medium-35 (a dense area: Hidden, 13.09 as errata'd - light OR dense) more than 21.5\" away, so Beta cannot see it before or after any 6\" move (detection range 15\"), while our U_PROSECUTORS_A on obj_center see it from about 10\" (an enemy within detection range with a clear line). The plan sends Beta on a Normal move toward obj_home_2 (26.2\" away): 5.7\" of progress and no objective this turn. Staying triples the mortar's expected hits (asserts 6-7 measure both on the engine): 5.0 expected wounds next Shooting phase (53.8 pts at 10.75 pts per Custodian Guard wound) against 1.7 after the move (17.9 pts) + 5.7 pts of progress = 23.6. The AI today never asks: it makes the planned Normal move. With FIX_INDIRECT_STATIONARY the post-move stage prices next Shooting phase's damage with the engine's own preview on both boards and Remains Stationary (53.8 beats 23.6 by more than the 5-point margin). Guard against an AI that holds every battery: U_CUSTODIAN_GUARD_D (Delta) has the same spotter and the same target but a BS 5+ [INDIRECT FIRE] lobba, which hits on a 6 whether it stays or moves (2.0 pts either way on the target; the move is worth 12.0 with its progress and a better target it brings into range), so it must still make its Normal move. Asserts 1-7 pin the premises on the engine (Hidden target, no line of sight, the only target, the spotter, no objective in reach, the hit ratios, the fail band with and without the spotter), 8-11 grade the decision text and the board, 12 checks the plan said MOVE, 13 is the BS 5+ guard.",
  "setup": [
    "var st = GameState.state",
    "# Behaviour under test ships OFF: switch it on for player 1 only. Loaded",
    "# inline (not from the bench profile) so the exam names exactly the knob",
    "# it depends on.",
    "AIDecisionMaker.load_player_profile(1, {\"parameters\": {\"FIX_INDIRECT_STATIONARY\": 1.0}})",
    "# No 2000-pt fixture fields an [INDIRECT FIRE] weapon, so two Custodian",
    "# Guard squads swap their guardian spears' ranged profile for constructed",
    "# artillery (melee profile kept). granted_by makes every model carry it",
    "# whatever the resolved loadout says (RulesEngine._get_model_weapon_ids);",
    "# unique names, because a weapon id resolves by name across the board.",
    "# Beta: the 11e Whirlwind vengeance launcher's BS 3+ and keywords, no",
    "# [HEAVY], 36\". Delta: a BS 5+ lobba (the Battlewagon's), 48\".",
    "var mortar = {\"name\": \"Exam mortar\", \"type\": \"Ranged\", \"range\": \"36\", \"attacks\": \"2\", \"ballistic_skill\": \"3\", \"strength\": \"8\", \"ap\": \"-2\", \"damage\": \"2\", \"special_rules\": \"blast, indirect fire\", \"abilities\": [{\"id\": \"blast\"}, {\"id\": \"indirect_fire\"}], \"granted_by\": \"exam\"}",
    "var lobba = {\"name\": \"Exam lobba\", \"type\": \"Ranged\", \"range\": \"48\", \"attacks\": \"3\", \"ballistic_skill\": \"5\", \"strength\": \"5\", \"ap\": \"0\", \"damage\": \"1\", \"special_rules\": \"blast, indirect fire\", \"abilities\": [{\"id\": \"blast\"}, {\"id\": \"indirect_fire\"}], \"granted_by\": \"exam\"}",
    "var arm = {\"U_CUSTODIAN_GUARD_B\": mortar, \"U_CUSTODIAN_GUARD_D\": lobba}",
    "for uid in arm:",
    "\tvar u = st.units[uid]",
    "\tvar kept = []",
    "\tfor w in u.meta.weapons:",
    "\t\tif str(w.get(\"type\", \"\")).to_lower() != \"ranged\":",
    "\t\t\tkept.append(w)",
    "\tkept.append(arm[uid])",
    "\tu.meta.weapons = kept",
    "# Beta and Delta on the west edge, west of area-medium-36 and more than",
    "# 6.5\" from every objective's range (no arrival this move). The Prosecutors",
    "# (4 x 32 mm) on obj_center inside its ruin, clear of corner-tiny-48 and the",
    "# corner-ruin-balanced-left-45 wall. Custodian Guard Alpha (P2) with every",
    "# base overlapping area-medium-35 (a dense area: Hidden, 13.09 as errata'd)",
    "# and none in its Solid generator-37.",
    "var place = {",
    "\t\"U_CUSTODIAN_GUARD_B\": [Vector2(60, 870), Vector2(125, 870), Vector2(190, 870), Vector2(92, 935), Vector2(157, 935)],",
    "\t\"U_CUSTODIAN_GUARD_D\": [Vector2(60, 720), Vector2(125, 720), Vector2(190, 720), Vector2(92, 785), Vector2(157, 785)],",
    "\t\"U_PROSECUTORS_A\": [Vector2(790, 1340), Vector2(845, 1340), Vector2(790, 1395), Vector2(845, 1395)],",
    "\t\"U_CUSTODIAN_GUARD_A_P2\": [Vector2(1255, 1385), Vector2(1255, 1450), Vector2(1290, 1515), Vector2(1355, 1515), Vector2(1420, 1515)],",
    "}",
    "for uid in place:",
    "\tvar k = 0",
    "\tfor m in st.units[uid].models:",
    "\t\tm.position = {\"x\": place[uid][k].x, \"y\": place[uid][k].y}",
    "\t\tk += 1",
    "\tif st.units[uid].has(\"flags\"):",
    "\t\tst.units[uid].flags.erase(\"last_shot_idx\")",
    "\t\tst.units[uid].flags.erase(\"shot_recently\")",
    "# Park everyone else, stacked per unit: player 1 inside obj_home_1's ruin",
    "# (area-large-14) so the home objective is held; player 2 in the south-east",
    "# corner, more than 42\" from Beta (out of its 36\" reach before and after a",
    "# 6\" move).",
    "for uid in st.units:",
    "\tif place.has(uid):",
    "\t\tcontinue",
    "\tvar u = st.units[uid]",
    "\tvar q = 0",
    "\tfor m in u.get(\"models\", []):",
    "\t\tif m.get(\"position\") == null:",
    "\t\t\tcontinue",
    "\t\tif int(u.get(\"owner\", 0)) == 1:",
    "\t\t\tm.position = {\"x\": 600.0 + 40.0 * float(q % 5), \"y\": 300.0}",
    "\t\telse:",
    "\t\t\tm.position = {\"x\": 1500.0 + 40.0 * float(q % 5), \"y\": 2300.0}",
    "\t\tq += 1",
    "return TerrainManager.area_at(Vector2(880.0, 1200.0)).get(\"id\", \"\")"
  ],
